    "description": "Time to know how smart you are!\r\n\r\nTest your brain, Solve the water sort puzzle games. This color water sort puzzle games stimulate your brain in a very fun and challenging way. Enjoy the brain challenge sorting games as you stack the colored liquids in tubes in water sort puzzle games. Let\u2019s see how good you are at arranging the color water in different tubes in this sort it water sorting games.\r\n\r\nThis color water sorting game is a challenging brain puzzle games. Use your brain and arrange colored liquids to solve the puzzle correctly. Get your head in the sort it challenge in water color puzzle games. \r\n\r\nQuickly classify the colored tubes until all the same colors are together in each tube and become a champion of sort it water color puzzle games.\r\n\r\nThere is a fun rule of this water sorting games that you can only pour liquid of the same color at the top and the tube you are pouring has enough space in it. So be careful while filling up the tubes using your IQ in this water color sort it puzzle games. \r\n\r\nThink, strategize, predict, and use color tubes at every move and look before pouring whether the other tube has enough space in water sort games. Win jewels at the end of each level, use the jewels to unlock more hints in this trivia puzzle color games.\r\n\r\nBe careful while arranging the glass tubes to make sure you don\u2019t get stuck. This water color sort puzzle games has simple swipe controls, hundreds of  levels, and no time limit. This amazing sort it puzzle games will hook you for hours.\r\n\r\nThis brain test sort it liquid puzzle games will make sure you enhance your IQ level  as well as kill boredom.\r\n\r\nWater Sort Puzzle Features:\r\nSort the glass tubes into respective tubes.\r\nCollect gems every time you complete a puzzle level\r\nGet hints in case you get stuck in this bottle games\r\nColorful graphics & exciting sort puzzle sounds\r\nEasy one finger control for the perfect pouring..\r\nMultiple unique levels with amazing water games challenges\r\n\r\nOfficial Facebook Link: https://m.facebook.com/TapNation-235177097407717/\r\nOfficial Instagram Link: https://www.instagram.com/tapnation.io/\r\nOfficial Twitter Link: https://twitter.com/TapNationGames\r\nSupport: contact@tap-nation.io\r\n\r\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy Link: https://www.tap-nation.io/legal-notice/\r\nVisit https Link: //www.tap-nation.io/",
